      "message": "Thanks for the suggestion. The PSM-based coordination approach sounds reasonable and could potentially provide a more robust solution.\n\nHowever, it may also be beyond the scope that PSM was originally intended to cover. If the community is comfortable with the current approach, I think it may be reasonable to keep the solution simple for now.",
      "parentUuid": "1c82dca2_308c77ed",
